up in a sheltered environment because of her rich parents. Because of her small appearance and innocent personality, she is treated as the class mascot, but she hates being treated like a child. She loves shoujo manga and the anime CurePre, but keeps her interests a secret except from Kazuya, who also like CurePre. Despite being afraid of men, she is able to speak with Kazuya normally."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c41387"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"その幼い外見と無垢な性格からクラス女子のマスコット的存在の少女。その分臆病で周囲に流され易いやすい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"雪菜とは親友だが、意志とは裏腹に女子達の多数意見に迎合しがち。基本的に男性恐怖症（主人公除く）。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"家は裕福な社長令嬢で、わりと蝶よ花よと育てられた箱入り娘。常に丁寧語の口調で話すも、舌足らずで難しい単語で噛む事しばし。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"子供扱いされることを嫌い「子供じゃありません！」がもはや口癖状態。そのくせ大の少女漫画（『なかよひ』『どぼん』といった小学生向け）好きで、女児向けＴＶアニメ「キュアプリ」の大ファン。もちろんその辺の趣味は誰にも秘密……だったのだが主人公も見ていて意気投合する。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"7898","sourceWorkId":"22857","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"雪菜の親友でクラスメイト。 裕福な家で育った箱入りの社長令嬢。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼い外見と無垢な性格から、クラス女子たちのマスコット的な存在になっている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"臆病で周囲に流されやすく、意思とは裏腹に多数意見に迎合しがち。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"常に丁寧口調で話すも、舌足らずで難しい単語はよく噛む。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"なお子供扱いされることを嫌い、「子供じゃありません！」 がもはや口癖状態。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そのくせ小学生向けの少女漫画や、女児向けのアニメ 『キュアプリ』 が大好き。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"趣味は秘密にしていたが、同じく『キュアプリ』を見ていた主人公と意気投合。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"男性恐怖症なのだが、主人公とは普通に話すことができる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「も、もえぎ…… 男のひとはちょっと怖くって…… ご、ごめんなさい」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"37879"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"好き","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"37879","value":"甘いお菓子、雪菜ちゃん、少女漫画、TVアニメ『キュアプリ』"},{"label":"嫌い","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"37879","value":"大きな犬、急に大きな声を出す人"},{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"72 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"7898","sourceWorkId":"22857","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"152 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"7898","sourceWorkId":"22857","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"77 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"7898","sourceWorkId":"22857","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"55 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"7898","sourceWorkId":"22857","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e5/e524574a751f54ec488d380523205e33b477d3b608d5585ebffdda4955927788.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/29/29539d0acd12e1cbf849affce02a57c0eb2a53122dcdc5b9b49eff6ed90e51c9.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"佐藤あずさ","creatorId":"vndb:s3868","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s3868","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s3868","name":"佐藤 あずさ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:155757:37879:16088:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c41388","characterName":"森永 璃歌","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"37880","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"155757"}],"egsCharacterIds":["7899"],"vndbCharacterId":"c41388"},"originalCharacterName":"森永 璃歌","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"b"},"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"77"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"159"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"81"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"54"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Likes: Cute ribbons, collecting cute stickers, baths, donuts"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Dislikes: Greasy and spicy foods (In reality, loves them)"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A beautiful girl who is a member of the idol group \"Lovematic\" who transfers into Kazuya's class. She transferred into Kureha Gakuen - which is currently a hot topic due to its mixed outdoors baths - in order to make a TV special about it, and gain more popularity. Though she seems sweet, her true nature is more blunt and darker; it easily comes out when Rika is fighting with someone."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c41388"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公達のクラスにやってきた転校生で、アイドルグループのメンバーでもある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"露天風呂付き学園として話題になったこの学校にＴＶの企画として転校してきたが、実はグループ内の人気争いの落伍者。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"アイドルだけあってかなりの美少女だが、実は猫かぶりで本性は結構な腹黒。周囲からチヤホヤされていないと気が済まない性格で、男子に媚びつつも女子のオピニオンリーダーになろうという態度に、対立派と親交派のどちらでもない、三勢力状態を作り出す結果に。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"特に代歩とは口論が絶えず口喧嘩ばかり。激高すると腹黒な本性が出てしまい、真っ先に代歩と主人公にバレる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"7899","sourceWorkId":"22857","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公たちのクラスにやってきた転校生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"アイドルグループのメンバーでかなりの美少女だが、残念ながら人気争いでは落伍者。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"露天風呂付き学園として話題になった紅葉学園に、テレビの企画として転校してきた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本性は結構な腹黒で、周囲にチヤホヤされていないと気が済まない性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"男子に媚びつつも、女子のオピニオンリーダーになろうとする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その結果、対立派と親交派のどちらでもない、第三勢力を作り出した。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"根がまじめで誠実な代歩とは口論が絶えず、激昂するとつい腹黒な本性が出てしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そのため主人公と代歩には、真っ先にその本性がバレてしまった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「アイドルに興味ないなんて、あんたホモ !?　それともロリ !?　熟女スキー !?　はっ、とんだ変態ね !!」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"37880"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"好き","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"37880","value":"可愛いリボン、可愛いシール集め、お風呂、ドーナツ"},{"label":"嫌い","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"37880","value":"脂っこいもの、辛いもの（本当は大好き）"},{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"77 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"7899","sourceWorkId":"22857","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label